%% Weekend 2.0 - Voice request flow. FigJam: https://www.figma.com/board/pMvZioGximavxDcsD14Ee9
sequenceDiagram
  title Voice request flow - push to talk
  participant Owner
  participant PhonePWA
  participant API
  participant VoiceWorker
  participant AgentCore
  participant Bedrock
  Owner->>PhonePWA: Hold to talk
  PhonePWA->>API: Upload audio clip
  API->>VoiceWorker: Transcribe
  VoiceWorker-->>API: Text, raw audio discarded
  API->>AgentCore: Run chat turn
  AgentCore->>Bedrock: Prompt, stream
  Bedrock-->>AgentCore: Answer sentences
  AgentCore-->>API: Sentence by sentence
  API->>VoiceWorker: Synthesize sentence
  VoiceWorker-->>API: Audio chunk
  API-->>PhonePWA: Stream audio and text
  PhonePWA-->>Owner: Play reply
